-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('G', ['N'], ['E'])
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL group_betweenness('G', 2) RETURN node.id, group_score, rank_in_group ORDER BY rank_in_group
---- 2
3|0.571429|1
4|0.785714|2
-STATEMENT CALL group_betweenness('G', 2, output := 'group_summary') RETURN group_id, group_score, member_count, members
